#set page(width: 12cm, height: 16cm, margin: 1cm)
#set text(size: 11pt)

1. raw author form: $c_{\{k,j\}}$

2. parens keep the escapes: $c_(\{k,j\})$

3. quoted chars in the group: $c_("{k,j}")$

4. code braces: $c_(#{"{"}k,j#{"}"})$

5. ordinary group in parens: $c_({k,j})$

6. plain: $c_(k,j)$

7. subscript with a set: $N_(e,0)$

8. one char: $x_i$
